# Walkthrough: Dynamic Voice AI Interview with Whisper & Llama 3.3

We have successfully transitioned the HRMS Candidate module from a static, text-reliant interview format to a **dynamic, conversational, and highly accurate voice-enabled AI interviewing system**.

Additionally, we identified and repaired a major project-wide blocker: **Groq's `llama3-70b-8192` model had been decommissioned by the provider**. We successfully upgraded all references to **`llama-3.3-70b-versatile`**, restoring 100% functionality to the resume parsing, evaluation, and question generation systems.

---

## 🛠️ Summary of Changes Made

### 1. Unified Audio Upload Middleware
We created a custom Multer-based middleware to receive and store candidate audio files securely.
* **Location:** [audioUploadMiddleware.js](file:///c:/Users/ADMIN/Downloads/files%20(4)/src/middleware/audioUploadMiddleware.js)
* **Features:**
  * Supports standard audio formats uploaded by browsers (`.webm`, `.wav`, `.mp3`, `.m4a`, `.ogg`, `.mpeg`).
  * Includes validation via file extension checks and mimetype inspection.
  * Enforces a healthy file size limit of **10MB** per response.

### 2. Upgraded AI Question & Audio Transcription Services
We added robust, high-performance APIs for transcription and conversational context generation.
* **Location:** [interviewQuestionService.js](file:///c:/Users/ADMIN/Downloads/files%20(4)/src/services/interviewQuestionService.js)
* **Upgrades:**
  * **Groq Whisper STT:** Integrated `transcribeAudio(filePath)` using `whisper-large-v3` on Groq (with an automatic fallback to OpenAI `whisper-1` if configured).
  * **Dynamic Openers:** Created `generateFirstQuestion(details)` to generate an individual tailored question based on the job description and candidate resume.
  * **Conversational Follow-ups:** Created `generateFollowUpQuestion(details, chatHistory)` which reviews the candidate's actual answers so far and generates intelligent, conversational follow-up questions in real-time.
  * **JSON Object Format Compliance:** Standardized all prompts to return a JSON object containing a `questions` array (e.g. `{ "questions": [...] }`) to guarantee 100% compatibility with Groq's strict JSON schema enforcement.

### 3. Smart Unified Progress Controller
We refactored the interview controller to support active conversation progression.
* **Location:** [interviewController.js](file:///c:/Users/ADMIN/Downloads/files%20(4)/src/controllers/interviewController.js)
* **Upgrades:**
  * Added `submitAnswerVoice` which intercepts raw audio file uploads, runs Groq Whisper transcription, and feeds it into the response evaluation pipeline.
  * Integrated a unified `handleAnswerAndProgress` engine that checks for verbal repeat requests (e.g. *"can you repeat that"*), logs answers in the database, and decides whether to compile a conversational Llama 3 follow-up question or conclude the session.
  * Automates AI evaluation immediately after the final question, storing detailed communication, problem-solving, technical, and confidence metrics in `interview_results`.

### 4. Registered API Routes
We exposed the new voice endpoint on the Express router.
* **Location:** [interviewRoutes.js](file:///c:/Users/ADMIN/Downloads/files%20(4)/src/routes/interviewRoutes.js)
* **Endpoint:** `POST /api/interview/answer-voice` (Protected with auth middleware).

