## 💻 Frontend Integration Guide

Here is a quick snippet for frontend developers to connect to the new voice system:

### 1. Recording Candidate Speech & Submitting:
```javascript
const mediaRecorder = new MediaRecorder(audioStream);
let chunks = [];

mediaRecorder.ondataavailable = (e) => chunks.push(e.data);
mediaRecorder.onstop = async () => {
  const audioBlob = new Blob(chunks, { type: 'audio/webm' });
  
  const formData = new FormData();
  formData.append('audio', audioBlob, 'candidate-answer.webm');
  formData.append('sessionId', sessionId);
  formData.append('questionId', questionId);

  const response = await fetch('/api/interview/answer-voice', {
    method: 'POST',
    body: formData // Sends multipart form-data
  });
  
  const result = await response.json();
  if (result.data.repeated) {
    // Speak the same question again!
  } else if (result.data.status === 'completed') {
    // Route to completed screen
  } else {
    // Save nextQuestion and speak it out loud!
    const nextQ = result.data.nextQuestion;
  }
};
```
